---
// Style guide section: Custom code and links
// Markup ported word for word from the original case-study.html.
---
<section class="section_style-guide-code" data-pane="style-guide" id="sg-code">
      <div class="section-frame"><div class="section-card">
        <div class="padding-global padding-section-medium"><div class="container-large">
          <div class="heading_component is-narrow" data-anim=""><span class="text-style-eyebrow text-color-brand">12</span><h2 class="heading-style-h3">Custom code and links</h2><p class="text-color-secondary">Only what classes can't express lives in custom code, and every modal has its own link.</p></div>
          <div class="style-guide_utils is-3-columns" data-anim-group="">
            <div class="style-guide_util is-card"><p class="style-guide_label">Site head</p><p class="style-guide_code">Figtree and the Finsweet scripts</p><p class="style-guide_code">Rules classes can't hold: tag styles, state selectors, embed SVG sizes, print</p></div>
            <div class="style-guide_util is-card"><p class="style-guide_label">Landing body</p><p class="style-guide_code">Upload steps, demo redlines, calculator, carousel</p><p class="style-guide_code">Sticky CTA, modal links, report protection</p></div>
            <div class="style-guide_util is-card"><p class="style-guide_label">Case study body</p><p class="style-guide_code">Tabs between case study and style guide, each with its own link</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="style-guide_links" data-anim-group="">
            <div class="style-guide_link-row"><p class="style-guide_code">/#terms-of-service</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">Opens the Terms of Service</p></div>
            <div class="style-guide_link-row"><p class="style-guide_code">/#privacy-policy</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">Opens the Privacy Policy</p></div>
            <div class="style-guide_link-row"><p class="style-guide_code">/#cookie-policy</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">Opens the Cookie Policy</p></div>
            <div class="style-guide_link-row"><p class="style-guide_code">/#cookie-settings</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">Opens the cookie preferences</p></div>
            <div class="style-guide_link-row"><p class="style-guide_code">/#sample-report</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">Opens the protected sample report</p></div>
            <div class="style-guide_link-row"><p class="style-guide_code">/case-study#style-guide</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">Opens this style guide</p></div>
          </div>
        </div></div>
      </div></div>
    </section>
